---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">Iris — Multi-Tenant Architecture</p>

  <div class="top-row">
    <div class="node node-light">Device A</div>
    <div class="top-connector"></div>
    <div class="node node-light">Device B / Trusted contact</div>
  </div>

  <div class="merge-down">
    <div class="merge-left-line"></div>
    <div class="merge-right-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="center-stack">
    <div class="node node-blue" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="node-name">8-character pairing code</div>
    </div>

    <div class="v-line"></div>

    <div class="node node-dark" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="node-name">Supabase backend</div>
      <div class="node-sub">Per-tenant isolation · Encrypted API keys · Signed URL file storage</div>
    </div>

    <div class="v-line"></div>

    <div class="node" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="node-name">n8n proxy layer</div>
      <div class="node-sub-light">Validates tenant on every request · No API key exposed to frontend</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="split-down">
    <div class="split-left-line"></div>
    <div class="split-right-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-row">
    <div class="node node-light" style="text-align:center;">React 18 + TypeScript frontend</div>
    <div class="bottom-spacer"></div>
    <div class="node node-light" style="text-align:center;">7-day auto-expiry sessions</div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-note">
    Each contractor is a fully isolated tenant. Frontend never touches an API key.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .node {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .node-light {
    background: var(--color-background);
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .node-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .node-dark .node-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.6);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .node-blue {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .node-sub-light {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .node-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .top-connector {
    height: 1px;
    width: 32px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .merge-down {
    display: flex;
    height: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .merge-left-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 25%;
    top: 0;
    width: 1px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .merge-right-line {
    position: absolute;
    right: 25%;
    top: 0;
    width: 1px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .center-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .v-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .split-down {
    display: flex;
    height: 20px;
    position: relative;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .split-left-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 25%;
    top: 0;
    width: 1px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .split-right-line {
    position: absolute;
    right: 25%;
    top: 0;
    width: 1px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .bottom-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .bottom-spacer {
    width: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .bottom-note {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .top-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .top-connector {
      width: 1px;
      height: 16px;
    }
    .merge-down,
    .split-down {
      display: none;
    }
    .bottom-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .bottom-spacer {
      display: none;
    }
    .center-stack {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
